**检索策略**：两个并行检索代理（PMC 全文搜索 + PubMed E-utilities）

**检索词**：
- "Gregoriou high-frequency long-range coupling prefrontal visual cortex attention 2009" → PMID:19478185 (PMC2849291)
- "Gregoriou cell-type-specific synchronization FEF V4 2012" → PMID:22325208 (PMC3297082)
- "Fries rhythms cognition communication through coherence Neuron 2015" → PMID:26447583 (PMC4605134)
